      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "These changes worked and have been merged.  ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I did, however notice that the current snapshot of fcrepo-vagrant, when FEDORA_AUTH was true, downloaded a file \"downloads/fcrepo-webapp-plus-webac-audit-4.4.1-SNAPSHOT.war\" that was not valid (ie, it was a 404 message or something) and had to test this against a different tag.",
          "type": "text"
