  "description": "<p>This task is to enable the migration-utils to run in the case where the destination F4 repository has authz enabled. <br/>\nThis will likely include an update to fcrepo4-client to accept username/password.</p>\n\n<p>To demonstrate that this issue has been resolved, run the migration-utils against the webac-enabled fcrepo4-vagrant:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo4-vagrant/releases/tag/fcrepo4-vagrant-4.3.1-SNAPSHOT-dcfug-2015-09\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo4-vagrant/releases/tag/fcrepo4-vagrant-4.3.1-SNAPSHOT-dcfug-2015-09</a></p>",
